{
  "info": {
    "name": "Huly TPI",
    "_postman_id": "huly-tpi-collection",
    "description": "Colección completa del backend Huly TPI (Spring Boot).\n\n## Autenticación\n- La colección usa **Bearer Token** a nivel colección con la variable `{{accessToken}}`.\n- Al ejecutar **Auth > Login** (o **Backoffice Login**) el script guarda el `accessToken` automáticamente.\n- El `refreshToken` viaja como cookie HTTP-only (Postman la gestiona solo).\n- Endpoints **públicos** (sin token): todo `/api/auth/**`, `POST /api/leads`, `GET /api/breathing/techniques`, `POST /api/webhook/mercadopago` y Swagger. En esos requests el auth está en `No Auth`.\n\n## Variables\n- `baseUrl`: URL del backend (default `http://localhost:8080`).\n- `accessToken`: JWT, se setea solo al loguear.\n- `userGoalId`, `riskWordId`, `conversationId`, `productId`, `adminUserId`, `emotionalEventId`, `imageFilename`: ids de ejemplo para rutas con path variable.\n\nSeveridades de riesgo: LOW | MEDIUM | HIGH",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string", "description": "URL base del backend. Cambiar según entorno (dev/qa/prod)." },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "JWT de acceso. Se guarda automáticamente al hacer login." },
    { "key": "userGoalId", "value": "1", "type": "string", "description": "ID de reto de usuario." },
    { "key": "riskWordId", "value": "1", "type": "string", "description": "ID de palabra de riesgo." },
    { "key": "conversationId", "value": "conv-123", "type": "string", "description": "ID de conversación del chat." },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "1", "type": "string", "description": "ID de producto/plan para crear preferencia de pago." },
    { "key": "adminUserId", "value": "1", "type": "string", "description": "ID de usuario para estadísticas de backoffice." },
    { "key": "emotionalEventId", "value": "1", "type": "string", "description": "ID de evento emocional." },
    { "key": "imageFilename", "value": "example.jpg", "type": "string", "description": "Nombre de archivo de imagen de un reto completado." }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Flujo de autenticación: registro, login (app y backoffice), renovación de token y logout. Todos los endpoints son públicos.\n\nEl refresh token se maneja como cookie HTTP-only. El access token se guarda en `accessToken` al loguear.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "register"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Juan Perez\",\n  \"email\": \"usuario@huly.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"birthDate\": \"2000-05-20\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Registra un nuevo usuario (rol USER). Devuelve access token + cookie refresh.\n\n**201 Created**\nErrores: 400 (validación: email inválido, password < 6, nombre inválido, edad mínima 13 años), 409 (email ya registrado)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "const res = pm.response.json();",
              "if (res.accessToken) { pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.accessToken); }"
            ] } }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"usuario@huly.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Autentica al usuario. Devuelve `{ accessToken, role, onBoardingCompleted }` y setea la cookie refresh.\nEl script de test guarda el `accessToken` automáticamente.\n\n**200 OK**\nErrores: 401 (credenciales inválidas o cuenta inactiva)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Login exitoso",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login" },
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"usuario@huly.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}" }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                { "key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "refreshToken=<jwt>; Path=/; Max-Age=604800; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...\",\n  \"role\": \"USER\",\n  \"onBoardingCompleted\": false\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Backoffice Login",
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "const res = pm.response.json();",
              "if (res.accessToken) { pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.accessToken); }"
            ] } }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/backoffice/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "backoffice", "login"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@huly.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Login del backoffice (valida que el usuario tenga rol ADMIN). Devuelve `{ accessToken, role }` + cookie refresh.\n\n**200 OK**\nErrores: 401 (credenciales inválidas, cuenta inactiva o sin rol ADMIN)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "const res = pm.response.json();",
              "if (res.accessToken) { pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.accessToken); }"
            ] } }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "refresh"] },
            "description": "Renueva el access token usando la cookie refreshToken. Rota el refresh token.\n\n**200 OK** (`{ accessToken }` + nueva cookie)\nErrores: 401 (cookie ausente, token expirado o ya usado)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"] },
            "description": "Invalida el refresh token en la base de datos y limpia la cookie. Idempotente.\n\n**204 No Content**"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "description": "Perfil del usuario autenticado, monedas, membresía y preferencia de tema. Requiere Bearer token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Mi perfil",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "me"] },
            "description": "Devuelve el perfil del usuario autenticado (id, name, email, role, flags de onboarding, themePreference).\n\n**200 OK** · 401 si no autenticado."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Mis monedas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/coins", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "me", "coins"] },
            "description": "Devuelve la cantidad de monedas del usuario: `{ coins }`.\n\n**200 OK**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Mi membresía",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/membership", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "me", "membership"] },
            "description": "Estado de membresía/plan del usuario: `{ active, planCode, productId, expiresAt }`.\n\n**200 OK**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar tema",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/theme", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "me", "theme"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"themePreference\": \"DARK\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Actualiza la preferencia de tema. Valores: `LIGHT` | `DARK`.\n\n**204 No Content** · 400 si themePreference es null/ inválido."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Onboarding",
      "description": "Generación de opciones de onboarding y marcado de tutoriales completados. Requiere Bearer token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Generar opciones",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/onboarding/generate-options", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "onboarding", "generate-options"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"step\": 2,\n  \"previousAnswer\": \"Quiero mejorar mi bienestar mental\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Genera opciones de respuesta para un paso del onboarding (IA). `step` entre 2 y 3.\n\n**200 OK** (`{ options: [...] }`) · 400 si step fuera de rango o previousAnswer en blanco."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Completar onboarding",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/onboarding/complete", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "onboarding", "complete"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"answer1\": \"Mi objetivo principal\",\n  \"answer2\": \"Prefiero un tono cercano\",\n  \"answer3\": \"Quiero recomendaciones diarias\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Guarda las respuestas del onboarding del usuario autenticado.\n\n**204 No Content** · 400 si alguna respuesta está en blanco."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Completar tutorial",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/onboarding/tutorial/complete", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "onboarding", "tutorial", "complete"] },
            "description": "Marca el tutorial principal como completado para el usuario autenticado.\n\n**204 No Content**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Completar tutorial de perfil",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/onboarding/profile-onboarding-tutorial/complete", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "onboarding", "profile-onboarding-tutorial", "complete"] },
            "description": "Marca el tutorial de onboarding del perfil como completado.\n\n**204 No Content**"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Chat",
      "description": "Chatbot emocional con IA: enviar mensajes, decidir sobre retos sugeridos y consultar historial. Requiere Bearer token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Enviar mensaje",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chat", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "chat"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"Hoy me siento un poco agobiado\",\n  \"conversationId\": \"{{conversationId}}\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Envía un mensaje al chatbot. Devuelve la respuesta del bot, emoción detectada, intensidad, acción sugerida, reto generado y metadata de riesgo.\n\n**200 OK** · 400 si message/conversationId en blanco."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Decisión sobre reto sugerido",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chat/challenge-decision", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "chat", "challenge-decision"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"conversationId\": \"{{conversationId}}\",\n  \"title\": \"Reto de respiración\",\n  \"description\": \"Practicar respiración diafragmática 5 minutos\",\n  \"decision\": \"ACCEPTED\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Registra en la memoria vectorial la decisión del usuario sobre un reto sugerido por el chat.\n\n**204 No Content** · 400 si campos obligatorios en blanco."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Historial de conversación",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/chat/{{conversationId}}/messages?page=0&size=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "chat", "{{conversationId}}", "messages"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "0", "description": "Número de página (default 0)" },
                { "key": "size", "value": "20", "description": "Elementos por página (default 20)" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista paginada de mensajes de una conversación, ordenados por fecha ascendente.\n\n**200 OK**"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Clouds",
      "description": "Funcionalidad de \"nubes\" (pensamientos guiados) con recomendación por IA. Requiere Bearer token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Guardar pensamiento",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/clouds/thought", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "clouds", "thought"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"thought\": \"Me preocupa mi presentación de mañana\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Guarda un pensamiento del usuario en la memoria vectorial.\n\n**204 No Content** · 400 si thought en blanco."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener recomendación",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/clouds/recommendation", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "clouds", "recommendation"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"thoughts\": [\n    \"Me siento ansioso\",\n    \"Mi presentación es en 2 horas\"\n  ]\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Genera una recomendación de actividad a partir de una lista de pensamientos.\n\n**200 OK** (`{ activityType, actionId, title, description, redirectUrl }`) · 400 si thoughts vacío."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Journal",
      "description": "Diario emocional del usuario. Requiere Bearer token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar entradas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/journal", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "journal"] },
            "description": "Lista las entradas del diario del usuario autenticado.\n\n**200 OK**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear entrada",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/journal", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "journal"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"Hoy fue un día difícil en el trabajo, me sentí abrumado\",\n  \"mood\": \"STRESSED\",\n  \"useTextForAI\": true\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Crea una entrada de diario. `mood` (opcional): HAPPY | SAD | ANXIOUS | CALM | STRESSED | ANGRY | EXCITED | TIRED | MOTIVATED | NEUTRAL. `useTextForAI` default true.\n\n**201 Created** · 400 si content en blanco o mood inválido."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Emotional Events",
      "description": "Eventos emocionales: creación y actualización de decisión/feedback de recomendación. Requiere Bearer token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear evento emocional",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/emotional-events", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "emotional-events"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": 1,\n  \"source\": \"CHATBOT\",\n  \"inputText\": \"Me siento triste y solo hoy\",\n  \"detectedEmotion\": \"sadness\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.95,\n  \"valence\": -0.8,\n  \"arousal\": -0.3,\n  \"dominance\": -0.5,\n  \"intensity\": 0.75,\n  \"userGoal\": \"Mejorar mi ánimo\",\n  \"generatedRecommendation\": \"Probá un ejercicio de respiración\",\n  \"recommendedActivityId\": 1,\n  \"chosenActivityId\": 1\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Crea un evento emocional. `source`: CHATBOT | DIARY | JOURNAL | CLOUD | NUBE | OTHER. valence/arousal/dominance en [-1,1]; confidence/intensity en [0,1].\n\n**201 Created** · 400 si validación falla."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar decisión",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/emotional-events/{{emotionalEventId}}/decision", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "emotional-events", "{{emotionalEventId}}", "decision"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"decision\": \"ACCEPTED\",\n  \"chosenActivityId\": 1\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Actualiza la decisión sobre la recomendación de un evento. `decision`: ACCEPTED | IGNORED | CHOSE_OTHER.\n\n**200 OK** · 400/404 según corresponda."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar feedback",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/emotional-events/{{emotionalEventId}}/feedback", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "emotional-events", "{{emotionalEventId}}", "feedback"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"feedbackScore\": 4,\n  \"feedbackText\": \"La recomendación fue útil\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "description": "Registra feedback del usuario sobre la recomendación. `feedbackScore` entre 1 y 5.\n\n**200 OK** · 400/404 según corresponda."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Emotional Recommendations",
      "description": "Recomendaciones emocionales basadas en estado VAD. Requiere Bearer token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obtener recomendaciones",
